_:na4d27ff3474e4b4298c11ae951e025cdxb0 <http://schema.org/text> "Lark were a South African band, probably the best band that will ever come out of SA imo. Unfortunately they broke up reasoning being they were simply not getting any &quot;respect&quot; from the local music industry, which is sh*t btw, despite having a large following. Any who, i thought it would be cool just to show you guys an extremely solid band and that South African music does have potential :P http://www.myspace.com/larksa http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lark_%28band%29 P.S I&#039;m not affiliated to Lark in any way :P I just feel people should hear an awesome band whose career got cut madly short. P.P.S. http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=beyJUmO2mw8 Their only music video for the song &quot;Moonlight&quot; which is off the album &quot;Mouth of Me&quot; (the better album imo compared to Razbulito which is very solid anyway)." <https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/forum/showthread.php?t=1218213>   .
