_:n9a48291e47664729840c735ab0bc75dbxb0 <http://schema.org/articleBody> "<div>SE Asia Stocks-Markets rise on Trump's tariffs respite, Thailand leads rally</div>\r\n<!-- no image -->\r\n\r\n<div>Southeast Asian stock markets mirrored a\nglobal stock rally on Wednesday, boosted by Washington's\ndecision to delay tariffs on some Chinese goods, with Thailand\nleading gains. \n    About half of the $300 billion worth of Chinese goods slated\nto be slapped with 10% tariffs on Sept. 1 are now exempted,\nincluding tariffs on products like clothing and footwear that<div class=\"feedflare\">\n<a href=\"http://feeds.reuters.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?a=M4DMaNg_T9Y:3D7BlsTpcMI:yIl2AUoC8zA\"><img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?d=yIl2AUoC8zA\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"http://feeds.reuters.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?a=M4DMaNg_T9Y:3D7BlsTpcMI:V_sGLiPBpWU\"><img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?i=M4DMaNg_T9Y:3D7BlsTpcMI:V_sGLiPBpWU\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"http://feeds.reuters.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?a=M4DMaNg_T9Y:3D7BlsTpcMI:F7zBnMyn0Lo\"><img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/reuters/UKBankingFinancial?i=M4DMaNg_T9Y:3D7BlsTpcMI:F7zBnMyn0Lo\" border=\"0\"></a>\n</div><img src=\"http://feeds.feedburner.com/~r/reuters/UKBankingFinancial/~4/M4DMaNg_T9Y\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\"></div>\r\n\r\nPosted by Reuters" <https://www.highleverageforex.com/se-asia-stocks-markets-rise-on-trumps-tariffs-respite-thailand-leads-rally/>   .
