_:n66723d3ba24a407b8cb1aa14292e66a1xb2 <http://schema.org/text> "Emperor Caracalla campaigned against the Parthians in the east and the Germanic tribes in the north. His Parthian campaign was largely unsuccessful, but he did secure a peace treaty. In the north, he defeated the Alamanni and successfully defended against the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caledonians\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Caledonians</a> in Britain." <https://rome.us/roman-emperors/caracalla.html>   .
