/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana,geneva;&quot;&gt;Available as MP3, M4A (Apple Lossless) or FLAC download.&lt;br /&gt;MP3 / M4A File is (256 kbs). .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana,geneva;&quot;&gt;FLAC allows digital audio to be losslessly compressed such that file size is reduced without any information being lost. Digital audio compressed by FLAC&#x27;s algorithm can typically be reduced to 50&amp;ndash;60% of its original size and decompressed into an identical copy of the original audio data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana,geneva;&quot;&gt;For more info on FLAC - &lt;a href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FLAC&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FLAC&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana,geneva;&quot;&gt;A link to the download will be emailed to you after your order is processed. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana,geneva;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: verdana, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;We will email you a link to download the Zipped file (MP3) or all M4A / Flac files from our download server at Sendspace.com&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" <https://innersoulutions.com/frequency-cds-mp3s/human-body-series/human-body-series-vat-frequencies-pkg/>   .
