sc-subtag=\"03YziYNAAWaFYF17vGcgxg9\" x-track-ga-click=\"1\" data-element=\"offer-group\" data-action=\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Noise Cancelling Earbuds (Black)\" data-item=\"Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Noise Cancelling Earbuds (Black)\" data-position=\"5\" data-module=\"offers-group\">\n    Bose QuietComfort Ultra Wireless Noise Cancelling Earbuds (Black)\n</a>\n                                            for\n                        <strong>$229.00</strong>\n                        \n                    \n                                            <em>\n                            (List Price $299.00)\n                        </em>\n                                    </li>\n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://cc.pcmag.com/v1/otc/01r1WRIAJykbQgN4oGQ8FSi?merchant=05kie42h3YvHwjr4G1w80Qq&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0D22FYFL4&amp;template=article-page&amp;module=offers-group&amp;element=offer-group&amp;item=Geekom+A8+Ryzen+9+2TB+SSD+32GB+RAM+Mini+Desktop&amp;position=6&amp;element_label=Geekom+A8+Ryzen+9+2TB+SSD+32GB+RAM+Mini+Desktop&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcmag.com%2Fnews%2Ffacebook-didnt-give-researchers-the-data-it-promised&amp;object_type=offer&amp;object_uuid=05m3qCZwTkP2OfhX7ry1ANh&amp;product_uuid=04Q6mrbJCwT2sZmQrwHi6cH\" data-commerce=\"1\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"(Opens in a new tab)\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-parent-group=\"affiliate-link\" class=\"roundup-offer-link font-stretch-condensed\" style=\"\" offer-uuid=\"05m3qCZwTkP2OfhX7ry1ANh\" data-aps-asin=\"B0D22FYFL4\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"p00935-20\" data-aps-asc-subtag=\"05m3qCZwTkP2OfhX7ry1ANh\" x-track-ga-click=\"1\" data-element=\"offer-group\" data-action=\"Geekom A8 Ryzen 9 2TB SSD 32GB RAM Mini Desktop\" data-item=\"Geekom A8 Ryzen 9 2TB SSD 32GB RAM Mini Desktop\" data-position=\"6\" data-module=\"offers-group\">\n    Geekom A8 Ryzen 9 2TB SSD 32GB RAM Mini Desktop\n</a>\n                                            for\n                        <strong>$721.00</strong>\n                        \n                    \n                                            <em>\n                            (List Price $849.00)\n                        </em>\n                                    </li>\n                            <li>\n                    <a href=\"https://cc.pcmag.com/v1/otc/01r1WRIAJykbQgN4oGQ8FSi?merchant=05kie42h3YvHwjr4G1w80Qq&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB071S84ZW7&amp;template=article-page&amp;module=offers-group&amp;element=offer-group&amp;item=Asus+ZenScreen+MB16AC+15.6%22+1080p+Portable+USB-C+IPS+Monitor&amp;position=7&amp;element_label=Asus+ZenScreen+MB16AC+15.6%26quot%3B+1080p+Portable+USB-C+IPS+Monitor&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcmag.com%2Fnews%2Ffacebook-didnt-give-researchers-the-data-it-promised&amp;object_type=offer&amp;object_uuid=07LTQiYkgLbbspCY3Y7Dbof&amp;product_uuid=07rj3pVkaPCbrESDSoRWCPU\" data-commerce=\"1\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"(Opens in a new tab)\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-parent-group=\"affiliate-link\" class=\"roundup-offer-link font-stretch-condensed\" style=\"\" offer-uuid=\"07LTQiYkgLbbspCY3Y7Dbof\" data-aps-asin=\"B071S84ZW7\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"p00935-20\" data-aps-asc-subtag=\"07LTQiYkgLbbspCY3Y7Dbof\" x-track-ga-click=\"1\" data-element=\"offer-group\" data-action=\"Asus ZenScreen MB16AC 15.6\\\" portable usb-c ips monitor data-item=\"Asus ZenScreen MB16AC 15.6\\\" data-position=\"7\" data-module=\"offers-group\">\n    Asus ZenScreen MB16AC 15.6\" 1080p Portable USB-C IPS Monitor\n</a>\n                                            for\n                        <strong>$149.00</strong>\n                        \n                    \n                                            <em>\n                            (List Price $229.00)\n                        </em>\n                                    </li>\n                    </ul>\n        <p class=\"-mt-2 mb-4 flex justify-center text-xs italic\">\n            *Deals are selected by our commerce team\n        </p>\n    </div>\n<p>The <em>Times</em> says the missing information was discovered by University of Urbino researcher Fabio Giglietto after he compared the data available in the company's <a href=\"https://www.pcmag.com/news/what-content-is-most-popular-on-facebook-its-complicated\" target=\"_self\">recently published report</a> about the top posts on its platform to the info that had previously been available only to researchers.</p><div class=\"py-4\" data-parent-group=\"related-stories\">\n    <div class=\"mx-0 border border-b border-l-0 border-r-0 border-t border-gray-300 py-4 md:ml-8 md:mr-24\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-stretch-ultra-condensed mb-2 text-lg font-semibold uppercase\">Recommended by Our Editors</h3>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\">\n                    \n                    <a class=\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-image\" data-position=\"1\" data-title=\"Facebook Accused of Stopping Watchdog's Research Into Instagram Image\" href=\"/news/facebook-accused-of-stopping-watchdogs-research-into-instagram\" x-track-ga-click>\n                                            <div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img class=\"absolute inset-1/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\" data-image-loader=\"https://i.pcmag.com/imagery/articles/06sI0T6avxw7bwwfpOH8ID0-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1628871114.jpg\" data-lazy-sized src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20/%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Facebook Accused of Stopping Watchdog's Research Into Instagram\">\n                        </div>\n                                        </a>\n                    <div class=\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\">\n                        \n                        <a class=\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-link\" data-position=\"1\" href=\"/news/facebook-accused-of-stopping-watchdogs-research-into-instagram\" x-track-ga-click>Facebook Accused of Stopping Watchdog's Research Into Instagram</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div class=\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\">\n                    \n                    <a class=\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-image\" data-position=\"2\" data-title=\"Nearly Half of Americans Want the Government to Restrict Misinformation Online Image\" href=\"/news/nearly-half-of-americans-want-the-government-to-restrict-misinformation\" x-track-ga-click>\n                                            <div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img class=\"absolute inset-1/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\" data-image-loader=\"https://i.pcmag.com/imagery/articles/03rgtL3maeOuBKJGCwLs7hn-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1629911493.jpg\" data-lazy-sized src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20/%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Nearly Half of Americans Want the Government to Restrict Misinformation Online\">\n                        </div>\n                                        </a>\n                    <div class=\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\">\n                        \n                        <a class=\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-link\" data-position=\"2\" href=\"/news/nearly-half-of-americans-want-the-government-to-restrict-misinformation\" x-track-ga-click>Nearly Half of Americans Want the Government to Restrict Misinformation Online</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                            <div class=\"my-4 inline-flex w-full md:my-2\">\n                    \n                    <a class=\"mr-4 inline min-w-24 max-w-24 no-underline md:min-w-28 md:max-w-28\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-image\" data-position=\"3\" data-title=\"Facebook Cracks Down on People, Pages Repeatedly Sharing Misinformation Image\" href=\"/news/facebook-cracks-down-on-people-pages-repeatedly-sharing-misinformation\" x-track-ga-click>\n                                            <div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img class=\"absolute inset-1/2 h-auto w-auto translate-center\" data-image-loader=\"https://i.pcmag.com/imagery/articles/01Znj5fnGnq2tlLHPGENUq1-1.fit_lpad.size_400x225.v1622110968.jpg\" data-lazy-sized src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%3E%3Crect%20fill='%23f7f7f7'%20/%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Facebook Cracks Down on People, Pages Repeatedly Sharing Misinformation\">\n                        </div>\n                                        </a>\n                    <div class=\"flex w-auto flex-col justify-center md:mr-20\">\n                        \n                        <a class=\"inline-block align-middle leading-tight no-underline\" data-module=\"related-recirc\" data-item=\"related-recirc-list\" data-element=\"related-recirc-link\" data-position=\"3\" href=\"/news/facebook-cracks-down-on-people-pages-repeatedly-sharing-misinformation\" x-track-ga-click>Facebook Cracks Down on People, Pages Repeatedly Sharing Misinformation</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                    </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p>Now those academics looking into the spread of misinformation on Facebook will have to wait several weeks (at least) to receive accurate data sets. The new information will require them to update existing publications and account for the lack of available data in their current studies.</p><p>The <em>Times</em> says that researchers told the company in a call that they were losing months of work because of this error, that doctoral degrees were on the line, and that they feared Facebook was \"either negligent or, worse, actively undermining the research\" because of this error.</p>" <https://www.pcmag.com/news/facebook-didnt-give-researchers-the-data-it-promised>   .
